  "content": "<p><strong>Description:</strong> This lecture starts with a demonstration of echo cancelation using deconvolution, and then continues to cover the spectral content of signals. Fast Fourier transform, and the effect of a low-pass channel are also discussed.</p>\n<p><strong>Instructor:</strong> George Verghese</p>\n",
